プト","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:253443","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"yuri(歌手)","creatorId":"vndb:s8633","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:30773","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8633","name":"yuri(歌手","detail":"主題歌「夢の予感」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:261659","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"yuri","creatorId":"vndb:s8633","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8633","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8633","name":"YURI","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:50820","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13648","characterName":"沢村 悠里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13648"},"originalCharacterName":"沢村 悠里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Head of the drama club. She is Nano’s sister. She has a straightforward personality and is popular with both boys and girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s a great cook, but she’s not good at complicated things (or rather, she can’t even think about them). During arguments over the protagonist, she often gets talked into things by Nano."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she excels at playing the love rival, in real life she lacks courage. Even when she immerses herself in seducing the protagonist, she tries to hide her shyness. it’s no surprise she’s still a virgin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13648"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e78833b6864e6c17495505ea66a3113c779cd5432c3fad1b73c69f634181b8c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a18d9ce04d1dc9022d9f1e50e19b0e6395cd0af383b99d0a3b6e2df194cddee.webp","width":250,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風音","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:28165","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13649","characterName":"沢村 菜乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13649"},"originalCharacterName":"沢村 菜乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist’s junior. She fell for the protagonist and enrolled in the same academy. Despite her appearance, she’s a terrible cook. She’s a shy girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She usually gets along well with Yuri and looks up to her like an older sister, but whenever the protagonist is involved, her shy personality completely changes, and she shows a bold side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves sweets and manga, and she can’t resist milk candy. For some reason, she also loves cows and loves wearing her moo-print pajamas. Of course, she’s a virgin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13649"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5ae9d51d8b442bc1cd11a3d858199cdd390fdc61fdb3879f2b61b2f693893397.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9f02cfef09df342cd08dbe43013a0c9527316e07925535b7e33af60d2b4f0a4.webp","width":250,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みる","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:28164","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13651","characterName":"沢村 茗子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13651"},"originalCharacterName":"沢村 茗子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head of the Sawamura household. A mature woman who warmly watches over the growth of the protagonist and her two “daughters.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s skilled at mechanical work, but both her job and her past remain a mystery—including those suspicious phone calls from a foreigner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s an expert at Russian cuisine and effortlessly keeps track of the protagonist and heroines’ every move, even discreetly monitoring the their romantic entanglements without being noticed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems to have a romantic interest in the protagonist, but hasn’t made a move yet. Still, she’d like to be part of their group…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13651"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a80eb581e262dc281975374e8eebe901a0539666eeb60c660270ffb68861c4c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93a8de15db5f08e35310c1ee8fc731b41ba8476a3338aa6fa02e79b2995c5492.webp","width":250,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"こむら 菜々","creatorId":"vndb:s4822","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4822","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4822","name":"こむら 菜々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:28166","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13653","characterName":"工藤 章人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13653"},"originalCharacterName":"工藤 章人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second-year student. He used to be a member of the drama club but has since quit. He’s an ordinary young man, except that his delicate features led him to be cast in female roles, which in turn drew dangerous advances from male students."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He performs at an average level in both sports and academics. His parents are celebrities who are often away on business trips overseas. Due to a scheme hatched by Yuri, Nano, and Meiko, he ends up moving in with them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he was troubled by Yuri and Nano’s confessions of love, he is, after all, a boy, and his honest body ends up accepting this lewd lifestyle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While he harbors some wariness toward Meiko, the fact that he accepts the high-performance, homemade sex toys she provides shows he’s completely hooked."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13653"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p724","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1009","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p724","name":"祭企画","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:3041:1009","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p724","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p724","name":"祭企画","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:10200:v4520","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p764","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p764","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p764","name":"SPEED","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-pro